<title>NETHERLANDS: NBM-AMSTELLAND FINALISES BELGIAN DIY SALE.</title>
<headline>NBM-AMSTELLAND FINALISES BELGIAN DIY SALE.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch construction group NBM-Amstelland NV said on Monday it had finalised the sale of its 10 Gamma &quot;do-it-yourself&quot; building material stores in Belgium to POGAM NV.</p>
<p>NBM-Amstelland said in May it intended to sell the stores, which posted 1996 turnover of 56 million guilders. It said then the shops were profitable but had not met NBM-Amstelland's profitability criteria.</p>
<p>No financial details of the sale were disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
